README.INVERSION

DISCLAIMER:

Data submitted by source providers may vary from version to version, including
changes in file names and file formats.  The source inversion spec is also 
subject to change.  It is the responsibility of the inverter to evaluate
source data and determine how/whether to accomodate changse/additions and
deletions, and to update the source inversion accordingly.

RSAB: RADLEX 

Last update of this file:  06/17/2026
Last VSAB inverted using this README: RADLEX_4_3 

Overview:  

A.  Files from source provider

1)  Required files
	RADLEX.csv -- This file was retrieved from BioPortal (http://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/RADLEX).  
	RadLex.owl -- not used for the inversion.

2)  Other files provided by source provider
	None

B.  Scripts and other files required for source inversion 
	concat.pl
	make_vb.pl
	invert_RADLEX.s - wrapper script to build *.src files 
	   Includes:
		findQaStats	
		makeDoc.pl
		makesrc.pl
		remove_dup_attributes.pl - removes dup attributes
		remove_dup_classes.pl - removes dup atoms		
		remove_dup_rels.pl - removes dup relationships 
		show-examples.pl 
   		simple.contexts.pl
		srcQa.pl
		stripblanks

C.  Process
(step-by-step instructions on how to run the inversion)

1.  Retrieve data file from BioPortal (http://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/RADLEX). 

	a. Download Radlex files from BioPortal to GFE.
	b. From GFE use SecureFX to ftp files to ncias-q3000/tmp
	c. From ncias-q3000/tmp copy files to the orig/fromprovider directory
	d. As user quansh, remove downloaded RadLex files from /tmp
         
3. Concatenate lines.
    bin/concat.pl 

4. Change csv file to pipe-delimited file
	bin/make_vb.pl

5.  Create sources.src by using "dump_src_info.pl [-d <db>] [-r <RSAB> | <SAB>]" and "make.sources.src.pl <filled-in-template> > sources.src".

6.  update termgroups.src and sources.src

7.  update *cfg file

8.  update and run invert_RADLEX.s wrapper script which includes:
        a. bin/makesrc.pl

        b. Remove duplicate relationships and self-referential rels
                bin/remove_dup_rels.pl
                cp ../tmp/relationships_no_dups_no_self_refs.tmp ../src/relationships.src
	c. Remove duplicates from classes and mergefacts
		bin/remove_dup_classes.pl
		cp ../tmp/classes_unique.txt ../src/classes_atoms.src
		cp ../tmp/mergefacts_new.txt ../src/mergefacts.src

	d. Remove duplicates from attributes
		bin/remove_dup_attributes.pl
		cp ../tmp/attributes_unique.txt ../src/attributes.src

        e. $INV_HOME/bin/makeDoc.pl -i ../src

        f. cd ../src
        g. $INV_HOME/bin/srcQa.pl -c ../etc/*cfg
        h. $INV_HOME/bin/findQaStats.pl
 

D.  Standard steps

1.  Review the ERROR_LOG and QA_FILE

2. Rerun inversion as necessary to fix problems.

Do some conservation of mass.  Start by running $INV_HOME/bin/conservation.s

Complete the si_proposal_<VSAB>.txt and review with NCI.  

Create the SIMS record

Announce that the source is ready for test insertion.

STYs will be created during the insertion process.

6/17/2026 - Default STY process below is OBSOLETE:
After test insertion:
	Create default STYs: bin/stys.pl -c ../etc/RADLEX.cfg -i 1
	(Valid sgtype for -i option:
	'<0 for said>, <1 for code>, <2 for scui>, <3 for sdui>)
------------------------
	Obsolete steps for creating default STYs. (3/19/2021):
		 create source_atoms.dat in cxt directory:
			awk -F\| '($3 ~/PT/){print $1"|"$3"|"$4"|"$8"|"$10"|"$11"|SOURCE_CUI|"$2"|"}' ../src/classes_atoms.src > source_atoms.dat

			awk -F\| '($3 ~/OP/){print $1"|"$3"|"$4"|"$8"|"$10"|"$11"|SOURCE_CUI|"$2"|"}' ../src/classes_atoms.src >> source_atoms.dat
--------------------------
		 create bt_nt_rels.tmp using 'PAR|isa' entries from src/contexts.src
		    awk -F\| '($2~/PAR/){print $4"||isa|"$1"|||"}' ../src/contexts.src > bt_nt_rels.dat
--------------------------

		run treepos.pl
--------------------------

		1. in the tmp directory: 
			a. run 'bin/make.par_chd_rels.pl RADLEX_3_15 ../cxt/treepos.dat'
			 	-creates files: 'all.terms.needing.sty.tmp' and 'par_chd_rels' 

			b. sort -u all.terms.needing.sty.tmp > all.terms.needing.sty.sort.tmp

			c. cut -f1 -d\| ../test/sty_term_ids | sort -u > sty_term_ids.said.tmp

			d. comm -13 sty_term_ids.said.tmp all.terms.needing.sty.sort.tmp > no_sty_term_ids

			e. $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/default.sty-v2.pl > ../tmp/default_sty_term_ids

		2. in the src directory:
		
			a.$INV_HOME_OLD/bin/print.stys.meme4-v2.pl RADLEX_<ver> N ../tmp/default_sty_term_ids
				-this step adds the STY defaults
				-creates 'attributes.add' file
				-cat this file to attr*src and then change the 'attributes.add' file name to attributes.add0

			b. $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/print.stys.meme4-v2.pl RADLEX_<ver> N ../test/sty_term_ids
				-this step adds the 'sty_term_ids' to attributes
				-creates 'attributes.add' file
				-cat this file to attr*src
				_cat this file to attributes.add0 to get a single complete file of STYs 
				that have been added to attributes.src

		3. notify inserted that default STYs have been created. There is a file of 
		attributes.add and also the default STYs have been appended to attributes.src.


After real insertion:
resolve SRC-SRC QA counts

D.  Considerations for next inversion:

E.  Inversion changes
	None
